只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Native-vision Windows computer-use for DeepSeek Harness: screenshots, UIA, OCR, and approval-gated input","id":"gh:1337883483","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-computer-use-win","slug":"secretxuan/dsh-computer-use-win","topics":["automation","computer-use","deepseek-harness","deepseek-v4","dsh-plugin","multimodal","ocr","oh-my-dsh","uia","vision","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Native-vision Windows computer-use for DeepSeek Harness: screenshots, UIA, OCR, and approval-gated i"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ve-vision Windows computer-use for DeepSeek Harness: screenshots, UIA, OCR, and approval-gated input"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-computer-use-win"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Windows computer-use bundle for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): screenshots, window and UI Automation elemen"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"t discovery, OCR/visual observation for text-only models, mouse/keyboard control, and direct Windows"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"visual observation for text-only models, mouse/keyboard control, and direct Windows Settings launch."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"With DSH 0.1.1-rc.2 or newer, the built-in `deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp` route receives `computer_s"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"creenshot` captures as native image content. DSH normalizes each screenshot to the route's pixel and"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" byte budget, then uses the DeepSeek Files API with an inline fallback. Text-only routes keep the OC"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"R-compatible saved-file flow."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The macOS-first sibling is Anionex/dsh-computer-use; this plugin fills the Windows gap."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What It Adds"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| `computer_screenshot` | Capture the full screen or a specific window. Vision-capable routes receiv"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"e an image; text-only routes receive a saved PNG path. |\n| `computer_list_windows` | List visible to"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"p-level windows with process, pid, title, screen rectangle, and active state. |\n| `computer_list_ele"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ments` | Search controls exposed through Windows UI Automation and return names, types, physical-pix"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"el rectangles, `click=(x,y)` centers, and diagnostics when UIA cannot see inside custom UI. |\n| `com"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"puter_ocr_image` | Run Windows OCR on an existing image file and return recognized text boxes with a"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"bsolute coordinates. |\n| `computer_ocr_window` | Capture a window and OCR it, useful for CEF/Chromiu"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"m/custom-rendered apps that UIA exposes only as a shell. |\n| `computer_observe_image` | Turn an exis"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ting image into a generic text-model UI map: OCR, coarse regions, clickable text centers, and heuris"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"tic visual candidates. |\n| `computer_observe_window` | Capture a window and return the same UI map, "},{"id":"p9s11","text":"useful for icon-only controls and custom-rendered apps. |\n| `computer_observe_media_controls` | Obse"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"rve the bottom/player area and report generic play/pause toggle state without custom pixel scripts. "},{"id":"p9s13","text":"|\n| `computer_search_in_window` | Generic search flow: locate a likely search field, click it, type "},{"id":"p9s14","text":"a query, and press Enter. |\n| `computer_locate_text` | Locate visible text in a window through OCR w"},{"id":"p9s15","text":"ithout moving the mouse. |\n| `computer_click_text` | OCR a window, find visible text, and click the "},{"id":"p9s16","text":"matching text center with an explicit purpose. |\n| `computer_open_settings` | Open Windows Settings "},{"id":"p9s17","text":"through the documented `ms-settings:` URI. |\n| `computer_click` | Move the mouse and click at absolu"},{"id":"p9s18","text":"te screen coordinates. |\n| `computer_type_text` | Type literal text through clipboard paste first, w"},{"id":"p9s19","text":"ith SendInput fallback. This keeps CJK text reliable under VDI/RDP filtering. |\n| `computer_press_ke"},{"id":"p9s20","text":"y` | Press a key or key combination. SendKeys is primary; SendInput is used for combinations SendKey"},{"id":"p9s21","text":"s cannot spell. |\n| `computer_scroll` | Scroll the mouse wheel, optionally at given coordinates. |\n["},{"id":"p9s22","text":"t spell. |\n| `computer_scroll` | Scroll the mouse wheel, optionally at given coordinates. |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The plugin has no native binary dependency. Every capability runs through a bounded PowerShell child"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"n has no native binary dependency. Every capability runs through a bounded PowerShell child process:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Capture uses `System.Drawing.CopyFromScreen`.\n- Window discovery uses Win32 `EnumWindows`, `GetWin"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"dowTextW`, `GetWindowRect`, and foreground-window APIs.\n- Element discovery uses Windows UI Automati"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"on, which lets text-only models locate native/accessibility-aware controls without seeing screenshot"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"s.\n- OCR uses Windows.Media.Ocr for text and coordinate extraction from screenshots or window captur"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"es when UI Automation cannot see inside custom-rendered apps.\n- Visual observation combines OCR with"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" coarse layout regions, suggested actions, media-control state, and simple icon/button heuristics so"},{"id":"p12s7","text":" text-only models get a basic UI map instead of a raw image path.\n- Pointer input uses `SetCursorPos"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"` and `mouse_event`.\n- Text input uses clipboard plus `System.Windows.Forms.SendKeys` as the reliabl"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"e path under Sangfor/VDI filtering, with SendInput fallback.\n- All PowerShell processes opt into DPI"},{"id":"p12s10","text":" awareness and UTF-8 output so UIA rectangles, screenshots, and click coordinates use one physical-p"},{"id":"p12s11","text":"ixel coordinate space."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Requires the dsh CLI on Windows."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Using Agent Teams through Oh My DSH? Install and connect this plugin in one step:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Install the prebuilt release (recommended):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Then verify the layer and boot DSH:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The unscoped package named `dsh-computer-use-win` on npm belongs to a different repository. Use this"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" project's GitHub Release URL to install this implementation."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"To develop from a checkout:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Or install a packed tarball:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Patch the `computer-use-win` row in your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Set `requireApproval: false` only for unattended tests or disposable environments."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Known Limitations"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Windows input injection is global: clicks go to whatever is under the coordinates.\n- Elevated admi"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"nistrator windows may ignore input from a non-elevated plugin process.\n- Win-key combinations fall b"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ack to SendInput, which some VDI products filter. Prefer semantic tools such as `computer_open_setti"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ngs` where possible.\n- UI Automation coverage depends on the target application exposing useful acce"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"ssibility metadata. CEF/Chromium/Electron/custom-rendered windows may expose only a shell pane; use "},{"id":"p31s6","text":"`computer_observe_window`, `computer_observe_media_controls`, `computer_search_in_window`, `computer"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"_ocr_window`, `computer_locate_text`, or `computer_click_text` for those apps.\n- Text-only DeepSeek "},{"id":"p31s8","text":"routes cannot inspect screenshot pixels directly. `computer_screenshot` returns a saved PNG path on "},{"id":"p31s9","text":"those routes; use observation/OCR tools to turn that path/window into text, UI regions, visual candi"},{"id":"p31s10","text":"dates, and click coordinates.\n- Visual observation is not a vision model. Icon/button candidates are"},{"id":"p31s11","text":" heuristics with confidence and evidence; verify after clicking."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
